Origin of this repository
-------------------------
The replicated key/value store components in this repository started as
coursework for CSE 452 (Distributed Systems), University of Washington,
Spring 2025. Some components were first developed jointly with a classmate.
Both parties agreed that the work in this repository is maintained as the
author's individual project; the original shared coursework repository is kept
separately.

Test harness and framework
--------------------------
The directory `jars/` contains the binaries of the course-provided testing
framework ("dslabs") and its dependencies, and `run-tests.py` is a course-provided
script (original author header preserved). These are the property of their
respective authors, are NOT covered by any licence granted for the rest of this
repository, and are included only so that the tests can be run locally.
Third-party dependency licences are listed in `jars/THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.txt`.

Because the harness is course material, this repository is private and is not
to be redistributed together with those binaries.
